  "description": "Timberjack XT 27.5+ is a fun-forward hardtail trail bike with adventurous features. The aluminum frame is built around our trail geometry, tuned for an effective riding position whether you’re pedaling up or flying down. Timberjack’s 130 mm RockShox 35 Gold RL fork lets you air it out with confidence or finesse your way through technical sections without losing your line. Smart on-bike cargo features let you carry more ride gear or bikepacking kit with ease. Alternator 2.0 dropouts open up new drivetrain and ride tuning options. The 27.5 x 2.8\" wheels and tires spin up quickly and deliver tons of traction. The Shimano XT 1 x 12 drivetrain brings refinement and wide gear range to the table.",
